 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_32f1991872c1bd3bf1e2",
   "sourceHash": "32f1991872c1bd3bf1e2855dd62549c6ce974b4ad9aacdce5979d59292847e6c",
   "text": "Kairali 的自有专利药物体现了其致力于让阿育吠陀健康方案在当今世界中触手可及、切合实际的承诺。每款产品都经过严格细致的检测，并遵循严格的质量标准，以确保对使用者有效且安全。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5e15e3a48796f3363085",
   "sourceHash": "5e15e3a48796f336308566347daaaebb772079a697b383be436c4482de1e3307",
   "text": "焕活身体、心智与精神",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_86075ef886db148864c7",
   "sourceHash": "86075ef886db148864c7529797c8dc74c43abb09ab74903cefa588d843886471",
   "text": "Kairali 的每一款产品，无论用于个人护理还是治疗用途，都以整体观念进行设计。阿育吠陀强调身体、心智与精神之间的相互联系，Kairali 的产品正体现了这一理念，致力于促进全面健康。从焕活身心的油类到增强健康的药物，Kairali 的产品帮助人们在生活中实现平衡与活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_66cf95e82fc2be78e004",
   "sourceHash": "66cf95e82fc2be78e004492f47fbc42b055037dfa4625fbf9a6f506713326308",
   "text": "对阿育吠陀正宗性的坚守贯穿 Kairali 运营的方方面面。通过采购天然原料、遵循传统制造工艺并重视可持续发展，集团在满足现代生活需求的同时，持续传承阿育吠陀的丰厚传统。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f2f9c72b7871863cee1",
   "sourceHash": "0f2f9c72b7871863cee18456130d5e73996455084d4ae475e7acd1949c6819e9",
   "text": "传承信任与健康",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cb4a1adcddfdd63e3547",
   "sourceHash": "cb4a1adcddfdd63e354766fcc257bf688c0435d4bc9fed6dccab74cf6192f65f",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 以信任、创新和对整体健康的执着奉献为基础，树立了良好的声誉。其产品将传统与技术完美融合，见证了阿育吠陀历久弥新的价值。无论是希望完善日常自我护理，还是应对特定的健康问题，Kairali 丰富的产品系列都能提供天然、有效的解决方案，助力更健康、更平衡的生活方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f47b12fecc2de16c909b",
   "sourceHash": "f47b12fecc2de16c909bfcf3d720e5fcb8f5373241a4290b61c0dac3e01a3dc8",
   "text": "阿育吠陀实习 | Kairali - The Ayurvedic Healing Village",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_702a4ef382c5a1134bb2",
   "sourceHash": "702a4ef382c5a1134bb2b79689fc7f8ef2c4aa6de2ef4576820f38a603ec9e46",
   "text": "参加 Kairali 实习项目，在阿育吠陀、瑜伽和健康领域积累实践经验。在喀拉拉邦宁静的阿育吠陀疗养中心向专家学习。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat' rendered as 疗养中心 (healing centre) to avoid resort/holiday connotations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d8e0fa6b41e454c6b614",
   "sourceHash": "d8e0fa6b41e454c6b614737cf6f0760e33eb3e9ede1063dc5a97c055173a3046",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 致力于通过实习项目培养新一代健康从业者、整体疗法实践者和阿育吠陀爱好者。我们的实习为您提供独特的机会，在我们位于喀拉拉邦、享有盛誉的健康疗养中心宁静而自然的环境中，亲身体验传统阿育吠陀治疗、健康实践、疗养中心管理以及可持续生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat' rendered as 疗养中心 (healing centre) to avoid resort/holiday connotations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0c441911f15112ae60f1",
   "sourceHash": "0c441911f15112ae60f17d21400cf8ce7cd150503ba9bab8e5a4fa604eacecdf",
   "text": "无论您是学习阿育吠陀、瑜伽、健康旅游还是整体健康科学的学生，我们的实习项目都为您提供充满活力的学习环境，让您在与资深专业人士共事的同时，深入领会阿育吠陀和整体健康的理念。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_df59209601480e53f9a1",
   "sourceHash": "df59209601480e53f9a14d53e11abd1b8ca7d7c236428d3e8c14c4763b95c605",
   "text": "七名年轻学生手持书本和文件夹站在一起，背景为白色",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fad13da274432465e06a",
   "sourceHash": "fad13da274432465e06a9253617c5f0ff1481e14b416bca5bbae79f45f8fd315",
   "text": "谁可以申请？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e23791ac6e50d11aab57",
   "sourceHash": "e23791ac6e50d11aab5752710419a5fcdf64d576baf71e77394fb3a69ad4d826",
   "text": "我们的实习项目面向：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_65c2d61f25b0fa6d50b6",
   "sourceHash": "65c2d61f25b0fa6d50b643a072ca4bd9c889ecaca3ed7cf06b3b5cc881f98905",
   "text": "阿育吠陀、瑜伽、健康、酒店管理及整体健康科学领域的学生和专业人士。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_53259de11f1192c02c6a",
   "sourceHash": "53259de11f1192c02c6a88e3ac30c39fe15fe438cd0e166ba5c562f17abe685c",
   "text": "热衷于可持续发展、健康旅游和有机生活的人士。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_558bfc99113fcb25dcb5",
   "sourceHash": "558bfc99113fcb25dcb5711f19f54bc2b11330d304105215290cda8761481f98",
   "text": "希望在喀拉拉邦一流的阿育吠陀疗养中心获得沉浸式阿育吠陀体验的爱好者。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Retreat' rendered as 疗养中心 (healing centre) to avoid resort/holiday connotations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e59b48c0df3216bd0cb8",
   "sourceHash": "e59b48c0df3216bd0cb8d61c3ede983af9e5c445b49eb2cdfd30d831c5774f42",
   "text": "研究阿育吠陀、瑜伽或传统医学的研究人员和学者。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_333c7ec381f50775d227",
   "sourceHash": "333c7ec381f50775d227fc2bdcbdbca877d0bf3c9e1b5f654a13823e614b0c66",
   "text": "实习能为您带来什么？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_613b455d5a26c2a7c4e2",
   "sourceHash": "613b455d5a26c2a7c4e28d0bc8530c67433a75089d438ac6e4121ca623d121de",
   "text": "由 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 颁发的结业证书。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7f88e0ecf6be53c7d999",
   "sourceHash": "7f88e0ecf6be53c7d999807755491e47d12529431d185a7953fe0f53c5fec095",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗法、瑜伽教学或健康管理方面的实践技能。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a99f1d4a079ceaffc955",
   "sourceHash": "a99f1d4a079ceaffc955ee0567189c75ad56ba97bb1e5a384cea5bcd6fd373b4",
   "text": "在真实的阿育吠陀疗愈环境中工作的机会。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
